flowchart TD
    A([A record's identity field changes<br/>address, name, city, province, postal, lat, lng]) --> B[Re-judge THAT source_key only<br/>against the OC it is mapped to now]
    B --> C{Still the same station<br/>by the station-layer score}
    C -->|Yes| D[Mapping unchanged<br/>no proposal, nothing written]
    C -->|No| E[Build a mapping proposal<br/>old OC -> new OC<br/>basis: text score and distance]

    E --> F{Did both sides of the pair<br/>move in the same run}
    F -->|Yes| G[M6: goes to manual<br/>a machine cannot say which one moved]
    F -->|No| H[Proposal is pending<br/>nothing has been written]

    H --> I{Person confirms}
    I -->|Confirm| J[Allocate a new OC location<br/>is_enable false, no live source<br/>write OC_MAPPING_CHANGED]
    I -->|Reject| K[Stays where it is<br/>the next run may propose again]

    J --> L[The record that was merged away<br/>is reactivated]
    J --> M[The old OC keeps its other record<br/>and its live source]
    G --> I
    D --> N([Nothing to decide])
    K --> N
